{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01569","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第三拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第三拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如羇囚兮在缧绁，忧虑万端无处说。\n使余力兮翦余发，食余肉兮饮余血。\n诚知杀身愿如此，以余爲妻不如死。\n早被蛾眉累此身，空悲弱质柔如水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}